{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "7ec9a0cd65203f0090350a227c583cace62972d1cb74861a9bddc8bbffe5ccb6", "ja": "14歳に残された謎", "zh": "14岁留下的谜团", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c3609a4856bf0a510f0df10e91466798c20ce6b2ed0362dbaa7efbc69e7d666c", "ja": "デュオ公演は大成功。可奈とやよいは二人に\nしかできない大人可愛いステージを披露でき\nた。お姉さん達も喜んでくれるが、本人達は\n少し釈然としない。結局、大人って何なんで\nすか、プロデューサーさん？", "zh": "双人演出大获成功。可奈和弥生展现了只有她们两人才能做到的成熟可爱舞台。姐姐们也很开心，但她们本人却有些难以释怀。说到底，成熟到底是什么呢，制作人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "301c707df889692a57b0e06718f0baeb14abac6624c9ff7c650c5b49c37df8ed", "ja": "（やよいと可奈のデュオ公演は大成功！\n14歳たちの精一杯は多くの拍手に包まれた……）", "zh": "（可奈和弥生的双人公演大获成功！14岁的孩子们竭尽全力，赢得了如雷的掌声……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ec9e9304dcf829574abb1621501020aeac0053793a35d98ff2eec43077bddc31", "ja": "（今日はその打ち上げに来たが、\nあれよあれよと参加メンツが集まって……）", "zh": "（今天来参加庆功宴，结果参加的人不知不觉越聚越多……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "ca007e7be51ccc974e8f0e94fa0f3ad2e13291779502e495601035c0cafa9d11", "ja": "やったー！　90点が出たぞ！\nやっぱり自分はカンペキだね！", "zh": "太棒啦——！拿到了90分哦！\n自己果然是最完美的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f777f87e1221cf7db0e5e7d4647e3f227f6bb7308beca3b739fdcf99049e1d81", "ja": "すごいね響ちゃん！　大人っぽい曲も\nきっちり歌いこなして……。", "zh": "好厉害啊，响！连成熟风格的歌曲也能唱得这么好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "6ffb35a6a7608ddbee93e5053a8c85c99b5f1518a708517fa3407f40e08940d6", "ja": "もちろんさー！　やよいや可奈に\n追いつかれるわけにはいかないからね！", "zh": "当然啦！我可不能被弥生和可奈追上嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "07a232b3dd83ccc05f8b34d6ef2cbad173b84d6fbbe416299d7064a9f055860e", "ja": "う～、年はずーっと追いつきませんけど～。", "zh": "呜～，年龄可是一直都赶不上呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "5274fa53e41d387ccecf2d55ac9dca22ba66fd6fdce5672c8d56b8931c7a7203", "ja": "でもでも、私たちも思いっきり背伸びし続けたら、\nもしかしたら～？", "zh": "不过不过，只要我们也一直努力装得成熟一点，说不定就能追上呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "b25ae1fd5847f2c809fa53ec4bee8a027158ee504b3e7c4a910654f87e83bc7a", "ja": "やよいと可奈が、自分より大人っぽく……。\nうぎゃーっ！　そんなの絶対許さないからねっ！", "zh": "弥生和可奈变得比我还成熟……  \n呀啊——！那种事我绝对不允许！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e867a75a330f904850b84e77ea465ba6892346e4f24fc596c36dc73d4bcc1960", "ja": "ふふっ♪　まだまだ大丈夫だと思うけど……\nでも、大人になる時はあっという間だもんね♪", "zh": "呵呵♪我觉得还完全没问题，不过……\n不过，长大成人可是转眼间的事呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "3f0cfa85fdb4a840277693c8273c5af2c4a36f59b852c5ca26e73dbc76225482", "ja": "やだ風花ちゃん深い！　さすが大人だわ～。\n私も気をつけなくちゃっ。", "zh": "哎呀，风花你说得好有深度！真不愧是成熟大人呢～\n我也得多加注意才行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "44388bbb1ac4ed2d33d305e34231c38c0f84c14b4427207d3bf0b77d4be141ef", "ja": "そうね、アダルティは心のありようだもの。\n実年齢は関係ないわよ、莉緒ちゃん♪", "zh": "是啊，成熟与否取决于内心嘛。和实际年龄没关系哦，莉绪♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "436bb9c5eddf3a8af209f35555d781afc8c91687767d3958b28607023adc58b5", "ja": "（盛り上がってるな……。\n大人数だからカラオケにして正解だった……）", "zh": "（气氛真热烈啊……。人这么多，选卡拉OK果然是正确的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1012_p", "source_sha256": "73a29de97b80e931c8e9f8f9b18237c9c7347f568de74e012382295ba0781a42", "ja": "（アイドル達で楽しそうにしてるんだ。\n飲み物やらの注文をこまめにとったりして過ごそう）", "zh": "（偶像们玩得挺开心的。那我就多帮她们点点饮料之类的吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "3f6ddc809361b0693c28ed3bfdf3287efdba20f8c6f2cfb06def192e9dbb6760", "ja": "それにしても、今回のデュオ公演、\n本当に素敵だったわ～♪", "zh": "话说回来，这次的双人公演真的精彩极了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "00f3e4ffdbf343e3fba8c46ad4c40169e1f6083772f0938952cab06554743557", "ja": "そうよね。大人っぽいんだけど可愛いっていうか。\nやん、二人ともなんだかズルい～！", "zh": "对吧。虽然很有成熟魅力，但又很可爱，该怎么说呢。\n真是的，你们两个总觉得有点犯规～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "3097fa55176526fff5ef8f9b8c3d65c147740cdaaab612613e5175412e0c2c61", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございま～す！\nやよいちゃん、私たちお姉さんに褒められちゃった！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你们～！\n弥生，我们被大姐姐夸奖了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "659e6fd36f9ed657b618db2f8e5458d8819d11b99c9ac82d4726acc30c839362", "ja": "でも、私たちは思いっきり背伸びしただけですよ？\nその、歌詞の意味も、まだよくわかってないし……。", "zh": "不过，我们也只是拼命装成熟而已吧？那个，歌词的意思我们也还没太明白……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "e3046910ef19fdf5750f53ae92011f2a15d1b9a12e1c9fed988ac48e9b4460e4", "ja": "あ、私も気になってたんです。レッスンの時にえっちな\n歌って言われたのに、結局公演も終わっちゃって……。", "zh": "啊，我也一直很在意来着。明明练习的时候还被说是首色色的歌，结果演出都结束了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6622bee7d4d47fe715b8a994bae1fdb7de05469f2fa3eaab89d68edccec35dd9", "ja": "あー……ほら、みんな、飲み物が空だぞ！\n注文するからリクエストしてくれ！", "zh": "啊——……看、看大家，杯子都空了！\n我要点单了，想喝什么尽管提！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "6b6e55dbe4b18051cda537b863109bfb6e698a36cd9af0fc719c6cb090537716", "ja": "そ、そうね！　私はコーラにしようかしら？\nほら、風花ちゃんは？", "zh": "对、对哦！我就要可乐吧？\n对了，风花呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f6eaad6f434835c6aa57303838cf9265bab29b5f9cfecbae459a235ad27365b2", "ja": "わ、私はウーロン茶で……あ、フライドポテトもあると\nみんなでつまめていいですよね？　ね、莉緒さん？", "zh": "我、我就要乌龙茶吧……啊，再点份炸薯条的话，\n大家就能一起分着吃，挺不错的吧？对吧，莉绪小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "a2c637da6425cdd5b29cb44a8d52cda5f4a081097a99c20c83d7b0153420ff86", "ja": "え？　ええ……いいんじゃないかしら。\nでもえっちな歌って？", "zh": "诶？嗯……我觉得挺好的呀。  \n不过，什么叫色色的歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "429310c726aa90c77cb41e92f24d881a5bf270fe6867179fef237190d8657179", "ja": "シークァーサー！　自分はシークァーサーソーダで！\nほら、莉緒も早く選んでよねっ！", "zh": "酸橘！我要酸橘苏打！\n喂，莉绪也快点选啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "78e0d9930b0e3d51ca296e732efdbbbeacd59e55eb01f44a2acd8d3f551eb9c4", "ja": "（ふう……。やよいと可奈の背伸びは、少しでも前に\n進みたい、早く大人に届きたいという意志でもある）", "zh": "（呼……。弥生和可奈努力装成熟，也是想哪怕再向前迈出一步，早点成为大人吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0376_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0376_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3a01058072584adf466076a5dd01342086fa7618df551a385776436dd7d57a1e", "ja": "（あっという間に過ぎ去る背伸びの時期……\nこれからも全力で駆け抜けてほしいな！）", "zh": "（转眼就会过去的逞强期……希望你们今后也能全力奔跑下去！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
